      "html": "<p>They inhabit shallow, overgrown brooks and ponds.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/18-toothcarps-killis-and-livebearers/aplocheilichthys_katangae_en/",
      "html": "<p>In the wild they feed on small water insects and crustaceans. In tanks they can be fed with flakes or frozen food.</p>"
